cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ANCHOR, please cite it as below."
title: "ANCHOR: Adaptive Natural-language Control with Human Oversight and Recovery"
abstract: >-
  A self-healing web automation agent that runs locally with Ollama and Playwright: a person
  describes the task in plain language, a small local LLM plans it, and the code acts, checks every
  step and asks before anything sensitive.
type: software
authors:
